"Cook of the Moment is an S-rank Rabbit cooking skill."
"One holder broke a deadlock at the UN with a single pasta dish, and now works on Artona II."
"Its meals are so good that diners have wept because the meal was ending."
"A holder must master a world's ingredients before cooking with them."
"The holder focuses on their own memories and moments, applying it again and again while cooking."
"Its food evokes feelings; a turkey's smell could call up warmth, laughter, family and friends."
"No dish is ever made exactly the same way twice, not even by the same holder."
"As it grows, the holder gains more control of flavors and feelings."
